10 Ethics Statement
During the tutorial, we will address key limi-
tations of LLMs for data annotation, including
social biases, high compute costs, and limited
eﬀectiveness in low-resource settings. We will
also stress the responsible employment of hu-
man annotators, with fair compensation, in-
formed consent, and reasonable working con-
ditions.
