ParaphraseThe FIN-Bench paraphrase task consists of sentence pairs where the goal is to determine
whether the two texts express the same or almost the same meaning. This probes models’ ability to
compare semantic content beyond superficial lexical overlap. We provide acloze formulation(CF), where
the model judges paraphrase status from the text pair, and amultiple-choice formulation(MCF), where
the label space is explicitly constrained to""kyllä""or""ei"". This subset contains 200 examples.
