Improving Translation Quality by Selecting Better Data for LLM Fine-Tuning: A Comparative Analysis,"Improving Translation Quality by Selecting Better
Data for LLM Fine-Tuning: A Comparative
Analysis
Felipe Ribeiro Fujita de Mello
Ritsumeikan University
