by a second matrix ∆Wso that the final matrixW ′ could be computed like this:
W ′ =W+ ∆W(2)
With this in mind, LoRA proposes a matrix factorization approach to approximate this
weight matrix ∆W∈R p×q by two lower-rank matricesXandY, such that ∆W≈XY ⊤.
As a result, the LoRA-based update is formulated as:
W ′ =W+XY ⊤;W ′i,j =W i,j +
