This decomposition reduces the parameter space frompqtor(p+q), significantly re-
ducing the computational complexity. Hence, this facilitates efficient fine-tuning and task-
switching capabilities in NMT models, enabling efficient model adaptation to different lan-
guages and domains by integrating these task-specific low-rank componentsXY ⊤ into the
base model. Therefore, for task-specific adaptations, the model weights are updated as
