Finally, to address the problem of catastrophic forgetting and to be able to incorporate
new knowledge into our low-rank matrices, we considered that a pre-trained modelf θ could
be viewed as a point in a hyperdimensional space, defined by its matrices and vectors, which
1. During our testing we had to calibrate (reweight) the individual contributions of each LoRA with a
