M(h|x).
3.2 MBR Decoding
Unlike MAP, MBR explicitly optimizes task util-
ity rather than model-estimated probability. Let
Ydenote the space of the (unknown) ground-truth
outputyfor inputxandu(·,·)be a utility function,
MBR decoding selects the hypothesis thatmin-
imizes the expected risk—or equivalently,maxi-
mizes the expected utility—with respect toY:
