4.2 Implementation Details
4.2.1 Training
For our model, we use CosyV oice2’s speech tok-
enizer, which has a single-layer, 6561-entry code-
book and operates at 25 Hz for 16kHz speech. The
outputs from the final Transformer layer of the
Qwen model are then projected into five distinct
linear layers: one for text tokens and the remaining
four for speech tokens. The same configuration
was used for training the model for each language
pair. We employed the AdamW optimizer with a
