and Table 2, our RosettaSpeech model, trained
exclusively without parallel speech, establishes a
new state-of-the-art for zero-shot speech-to-speech
translation on the CVSS-C benchmark. It sig-
nificantly outperforms prior systems, even those
trained with parallel speech data.
