biguous expressions. Consequently, LLMs are in-
creasingly surpassing conventional NMT models
inversatility( Pengetal. ,2023;Hendyetal. ,2023;
Zhuetal. ,2023).
Recent research has leveraged in-context learn-
ing (ICL) (Brown et al., 2020; Dong et al., 2022)
