A Ablation and Auxiliary Experiments on DiscoX and Metric-S
A.1 Multiple Runs on DiscoX
To probe the stability of model outputs and the quality of Data đWe further perform multiple independent
runs (three trials) for each model. As shown in Table 6, the negligible performance difference across trials
indicates that the model produces consistent high-quality outputs across multiple samples, suggesting both
strong model robustness and reliable evaluation.
