These results indicate that although the absolute accuracy of Metric-S is influenced by the underlying capa-
bility of the judge model, the observed robustness is not specific to Gemini. Instead, the stability of Metric-S
reflects properties that are inherent to its evaluation design, rather than being an artifact of a particular
judge model.
