Expected Gender Categories. For each cloze
sentence, the masked word was annotated with an
expected gender category. We used M (male), F (fe-
male), and N (neutral), as well as composite labels
(N==M, N==F, F==M, M==F) to capture ambigu-
ous or neutral contexts aligned with gendered read-
ings. Annotation was performed by native speakers
and cross-veriﬁed.
