Style of Explicitations
Each explicitation is additionally annotated for its
integration style:
R:replace–replacingtermsinthesourcebyterms
in the target (e.g., “1 mile”→“1.6km”).
A:add– adding terms in the target additionally to
the content of the source text (e.g., “1 mile”→
“1 mile(1.6km)”).
