network (RNN) that is well-suited for handling sequential data and capturing long-term dependencies. In Machine 
Translation, a deep LSTM network can be used as the backbone of a sequence -to-sequence model, which takes a 
source sentence as input and generates a target translation as output. The network consists of an encoder and a 
decoder, each composed of multiple LSTM layers. 
