dog, illustrating English grammar"". Here the encoder would encode the input text into a fixed-
length vector, and the decoder would use this vector to produce a condensed summary of the 
source-language. In conclusion, in both examples, the encoder and the decoder transform input 
data into a format that can process and interpret, in order to generate meaningful output.  
  
