the target language. While ""a lista"" is a valid translation for ""to list""  in certain contexts, its 
usage might not fully capture the intended meaning of acknowledgment or recognition in 
official documentation or listings. In conclusion, the mistranslation by Google Translate 
highlights the importance of considering semantic pre cision, collocational accuracy, and 
