Dataset Availability
The Bhili-Hindi-English Parallel Corpus (BHEPC)
presented in this study constitutes the first large-
scale, high-quality resource for the extremely
low-resource Bhili language. Curated through
community-driven efforts, BHEPC aims to facili-
tate research in low-resource machine translation
and promote the digital inclusion of marginalized
tribal communities. Given the cultural sensitivity
of the Bhili language, its endangered status, and the
ongoing research objectives associated with this
work, access to the BHEPC dataset will be pro-
vided upon request to researchers and institutions
for academic and non-commercial purposes.
