5 Experiments and Analysis
To validate the utility of HalloMTBench and diag-
nose the hallucinatory behaviors of contemporary
LLMs, we conducted a large-scale evaluation. This
section details our experimental setup and presents
a multi-faceted analysis of the results, leveraging
our proposed taxonomy to uncover model-specific
failure patterns.
