4 Experimental Design
This section outlines the prompting strategies,
model configurations, and evaluation metrics used
across all experiments, including idiom transla­
tion, idiom classification, English–Urdu back­
translation, and Native­Roman Urdu comparison.
4.1 Prompting Strategies
Table 3 shows the set of prompting strategies used
in the experiments.
All large language model experiments were car­
ried out using a chat­based interface in which the
