we
 
clearly
 
state
 
that
 
translations
 
are
 
generated
 
using
 
AI
 
technology
 
and
 
include
 
a
 
disclaimer
5
 
noting
 
that
 
errors
 
or
 
omissions
 
may
 
occur.
 
Omissions—when
 
content
 
from
 
the
 
source
 
text
 
