We evaluateQwen3-32Bwhen sampling with temperatures 0.2, 0.4, 0.6, 0.8 and 1.0 and plot the
results in Figure 2. As opposed to default usage recommendations for TMs, sampling degrades the
performance, confirming the results obtained by Chen et al. (2025) withDeepSeek-R1-670B. In
addition, at each temperature, outputting thinking tokens or not gives approximately the same level
of performance. We observe a slight performance gap in favor of thinking tokens with respect to
