A.2 IMPLEMENTATIONDETAILS
We use HuggingFace’s Transformers library (Wolf et al., 2020; Gugger et al., 2022). We adopt the
prompt template introduced by Xu et al. (2024a), and compute the loss only on the target (trans-
lation or intermediate tokens followed by the translation). We use the same prompt when evalu-
ating the checkpoints. During COTFT the target is formatted as<think>\n{Intermediate
Tokens}\n</think>\n\nFinal Translation\n{Target translation}.
Translate this from English to Hausa:
English: ""We now have 4-month-old mice that are non-diabetic that used to
be diabetic,"" he added.
Hausa:
For intruction-following models and thinking models we use the following evaluation prompt.
Please write a high-quality Xhosa translation of the following English
sentence
