6 Complementary Analysis
6.1 Comparison with WIKITYPOS
To further validate the realism of MULTYPO, we
compare it with WIKITYPOS(Aliakbarzadeh et al.,
2025), a multilingual dataset of real-world ed-
its extracted from Wikipedia edit history. 4 We
extract typo pairs from WIKITYPOSand inject
them into our evaluation datasets. As an addi-
tional baseline, we include a naive typo genera-
tion method that applies the same four operations
described in §3.1, but without considering key-
board layout constraints. We conduct experiments
on four overlapping languages (English, German,
French, Hindi) using gemma-3-4b-it. Evaluation
is performed across five tasks (XNLI, Belebele,
MMMLU, MGSM, Flores200) under varying typo
rates (10%, 40%, 70%).
