Quality Validation.To verify the reliability and
consistency of expert annotations, we computed
inter-annotator agreement (IAA) using two comple-
mentary measures: (1)Simple Agreement, which
reports the proportion of identical labels across
raters, and (2)Cohen’s κ (Cohen, 1960), which
adjusts for chance agreement.
