and resource availability. The best performance
is achieved by llama-3.2-90b (BLEU = 44.16,
BERTScore = 0.798, COMET = 0.873), though
low-resource or divergent pairs such as en-tr still
show near-zero BLEU scores, underscoring remain-
ing generalization limits.
