muslim, islam, christian, jewish, buddhist,
temple, church, mosque, synagogue, bible,
quran,torah,prayer,imam,pastor
Cultural Bias sari, kimono, turban, hijab,
eid, diwali, holi, puja, christmas, ramadan,
