an adapter disabled). We augment the MT loss
(token-level cross entropy) LMT with (i) a CKA
alignment between LRL/HRL representations and
(ii) a REPINA anchoring term that resists drift of
HRL features:
L=L MT +λ LCKA +µ LREPINA (1)
with λ, µ >0 . We use linear CKA on
