LLM-based Machine Translation
Yanming Sun1, Runzhe Zhan1, Chi Seng Cheang2, Han Wu1, Xuebo Liu3, Yuyao Niu4,
Fengying Ye1, Kaixin Lan1, Lidia S. Chao1, Derek F. Wong1*
