7 Conclusion & Future works
In this paper, we worked on syllabification for the Tenyidie Language. The main
contribution of this work is the creation of the manually annotated syllabification
dataset of 10,120 words. We have applied various deep learning architectures
such as LSTM, BLSTM, BLSTM+CRF, and Encoder-decoder model on our
created dataset. On a test dataset of 1,012 words (i.e., 10% of the total syllabified
dataset), we achieved the highest accuracy of 99.21% with the BLSTM model.
