"The Hidden Costs of Translation Accuracy: Distillation, Quantization, and Environmental Impact","The Hidden Costs of Translation Accuracy: Distillation,
Quantization, and Environmental Impact
Dhaathri Vijay 1 and Anandaswarup Vadapalli 2
