District Court held that the applicant should be held in the detention centre. On 24 January 2012
the Kaluga Regional Court upheld the District Court’s decision on appeal. On 12 April 2012 the
District Court refused the applicant’s request in a summary fashion. He shared Cell 13 measuring
8.7 square metres with five Uzbek nationals awaiting deportation. The cell had only one window, 90
