visual similarity, while Claude-3.5-sonnet, Gemini-2.5-flash, and GPT-
4.1 achieve reasonable textual overlap and validity. Chart-specific
open-source models (e.g., ChartInstruct, UniChart, TinyChart) fail to
produce valid Vega-Lite specifications; as they are not designed for
forward chart generation, we exclude them from NL2Chart reporting.
For chart schema parsing (Table 2), CycleChart-7B again achieves
the best performance, with the 3B version obtaining a strong result,
highlighting the benefits of our training pipeline. Apart from Cy-
cleChart, general VLMs such as Gemini-2.5-pro and Gemini-2.5-flash
also perform reasonably well on this task. ChartInstruct-LLaMA2,
