For chart data parsing (Table 2), we follow the pipeline described
in section 5: at test time the model first predicts a schema from the
chart image, then extracts the data table conditioned on its own pre-
dicted schema (not the gold one). CycleChart-7B achieves an RNSS
score of 95.29, significantly outperforming all existing models. The
3B variant also attains a strong score of 90.84, demonstrating the effec-
tiveness of our consistency-based training in enhancing data extraction
