that each pair a specific key‑type with a specific value‑type. By keeping all other factors constant, we can
attribute performance differences directly to the nature of the needle. The results ( Table 4) reveal a clear
hierarchy: The results show a systematic decline in retrieval accuracy as the semantic “richness” of the
needle diminishes. This finding aligns with the observations reported by Hsieh et al. [ 23] on the brittleness
of retrieval‑oriented LLMs to identifier‑like queries.
