matical reasoning, the system identifies algebraic
manipulation requirements and selects symbolic
notation over verbose descriptions. We analyse the
adaptivity of domains and density-aware control in
Appendix B.
High-density Reasoning.The high-density rea-
soning component constitutes the core of our frame-
work. Given the domain parameters identified in
query analysis, we construct a density-optimized
reasoning prompt that instructs the model to em-
ploy domain-specific compression techniques. The
high-density reasoning process is formalized as:
