In practice, SmartChunk can be seamlessly integrated with sharded vector databases (e.g.,
FAISS Douze et al. (2024), ScaNN Sun et al. (2023b)) and supports parallel retrieval across chunk
hierarchies, enabling real-time performance. The adaptive planner also reduces the number of re-
trieval calls per query, lowering cost and latency as corpus size increases.
