4.2 Romanian Visual Question Answering
The three fine-tuned models, together with their base models, were evaluated for Visual Question Answering on the
RoFlickr30k-QA dataset. For each image, the model-generated answer was compared against the reference answer using
BERTScore (precision, recall, and F1), ROUGE-L (precision, recall, and F1), and BLEU. Please note that automatic
metrics are computed against a single reference answer, which may not capture all equivalently correct phrasings, so we
use BERTScore to help address this issue.
