2.3.4 Linearization
A critical failure mode in standard RAG is the loss of discourse coherence when disjoint chunks are
concatenated. Thanks to the explicit coordinates id provided by our Decomposer, we apply aRe-ordering
Protocol. The selected spans in C are sorted by their original start indices idstart before concatenation.
This restoration of logical order enables the downstream LLM to perform effective reasoning across
discontinuous but structurally organized segments.
