“Indices Only” and our method highlights that explicit text generation acts as a crucial semantic anchor
for structural prediction. Second, the model exhibits remarkable data efficiency; even when scaled down
to just20%of the training data, it achieves a TED of 4.87 and retains over91%of the full model’s accuracy.
