Figure 1: The proposed Personalization Editing framework outperforms prompting-based methods in multi-turn
conversations and surpasses fine-tuning-based approaches in both accuracy and efficiency. Furthermore, its enhanced
clustering-based preference representation enables the framework to recall user preferences even in challenging
implicit queries, where existing methods often fail.
