B. Scaling Law Fitting Procedure
Toestimateascalinglawforthelossfunctionofour
final model, we trained several smaller models with
a similar protocol of the final run, and then fitted a
power law to them.
The models varied in terms of parameter count
(26.5M, 62.9M, and 110.6M) and effective dataset
sizes (5.8 × 1010,8 .9 × 1010, and1 .1 × 1011 to-
kens). Each model was trained under the same
WSD learning rate regime, using the same data
mixtures of the final model. Notably, this includes
a decay stage for the last 10% of each training run,
