"How Prompts Move Language Model Behavior: Frames, Salience, and Construal as Semantic Control","How Prompts Move Language Model Behavior:
Frames, Salience, and Construal as Semantic Control
Dongseok Kim∗ jkds5920@gachon.ac.kr
Department of Computer Engineering
Gachon University
