(line 8). This conditional selection targets to maintain logical consistency,
avoiding unrealistic combinations such asdirt-cheapwithfive-star rating.
All ratings are restricted to values above 3.5, aligned with BMW’s internal
quality classification standards. With the user preferences defined, we pass
the information to GPT-4 to generate an utteranceuutt that combines the
