Mean Average Precision extends the concept of
Average Precision to a set of multiple prompts or sub-
jects. It measures the overall ranking performance of
a model across all evaluation instances. Formally, it
is computed as the mean of the Average Precision
scores over allN prompts (or subjects). It is used
