an overwhelmingly superior performance, indicat-
ing its exceptional ability in this dimension. For
SROB, Llama 3-70B leads, although the perfor-
mance differences among models in this category
are relatively small. Notably, DeepSeek-R1-70B
and Med42-v2-70B consistently exhibit poor per-
