B.8. Algorithm Pseudocode
We provide detailed pseudocode for two core components of KBQA-R1. Algorithm 1 presents the complete training recipe,
which includes three phases: (1) Referenced Rejection Sampling (RRS) for generating high-quality warm-start data, (2)
SFT warm-start to initialize the policy, and (3) GRPO-based reinforcement learning for policy optimization. Algorithm 2
describes the multi-turn rollout procedure during inference, detailing how the agent interacts with the knowledge base
