A Experiment Configurations and Hyperparameters
Our experimental setup begins with supervised fine-tuning (SFT) as outlined in Table 2. We use the
Gemma-2-2b-it model as our base, employing LoRA adaptation with rank 16 for efficient parameter
updates. The SFT training utilizes a cosine learning rate scheduler with warmup and is conducted for
a single epoch to establish our baseline model.
