an additional 200 users with diverse demographic
information and compare the DIRECTPROMPT-
INGAcc and B-Acc using a p-test (see Table 3 &
Table 4).
As shown in Table 4, all Acc and B-Acc compar-
isons yield p-values greater than 0.05, indicating
no significant difference between sampling 100 and
200 users. These results suggest that a sample size
of 100 users is sufficient and can be considered a
valid choice even when scaling up.
B Distributions Across Three Domains
