categories (country of birth, educational level, re-
ligious denomination, sex, and year of birth) for
the gender, government, and religion domains. No-
tably, all demographic features exhibit disparities
exceeding 60%, indicating that LLMs can reflect
differences associated with diverse demographic
backgrounds to an extent.
