Where, 𝑎 being the original activation function while additional activations allows 
the model to learn and adapt better. 
 
AdaNorm: AdaNorm (𝐴𝑛) for v input vector it is given by: 
 
  𝐴𝑛 = 𝐾 (1 − 𝑙𝑡) ° 𝑡,   𝑡 = 𝐴 −  𝜇 𝜎⁄ ,   𝜇 =  1 𝐶⁄ (∑ 𝑎𝑖𝐶𝑖=1 ),   
