the results show a clear beneﬁt from self-evolving functionality as SEAL con-
tinuously improves its inference capability through accumulated experience.
Conversely, lacking the memory module, the ablated model cannot sustain
this learning, reﬂected in slower performance growth. This directly vali-
dates the proposed self-evolving architecture, showing system performance
improves with increasing dialog turns.
