6 ANALYSIS
To better understand the differences in speedup values betweenbaseandinstructmodels,andthe
variation in speedups across benchmarks, we analyze how predictive uncertainty evolves over the
reverse-diffusion chain. We track per-token predictive entropy on the generated region at each step
t. Using the per-position distributionsp t,i statex t, the mean per-token entropy is
