A.1 SAMPLINGHYPER-PARAMETERS
Forclosed-endedbenchmarks across all tested models, we set temperature=0.6 and top-p=1.0 (i.e.,
no probabilistic truncation). Foropen-endedLiveCodeBench, we use model-specific settings: for
Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct , we set temperature=0.7 and top-p=0.8 (because it is a non-
reasoning model). For all other models, we set temperature=0.6 and top-p=0.95.
