with ground-truth translations, summaries, and QA
pairs, we evaluate our approach on established
benchmarks that approximate these tasks. For im-
age translation, we use the VISTRA benchmark
(Salesky et al., 2024), which contains real-world
images such as street signs with ground-truth OCR
and translations for English → German, Chinese,
