HealthContradict: Evaluating Biomedical Knowledge Conflicts in Language Models,"HealthContradict: Evaluating Biomedical Knowledge
Conflicts in Language Models
Boya Zhang1*, Alban Bornet1, Rui Yang2, Nan Liu3,4, and Douglas Teodoro1
1Faculty of Medicine, University of Geneva, Geneva, Switzerland
