E. Limitations and Future Work
Although STREAM GAZE offers the first comprehensive
benchmark for gaze-guided streaming reasoning, some
limitations suggest promising avenues for future work.
STREAM GAZE spans ten heterogeneous tasks with inher-
ently imbalanced sample sizes, and future work could ex-
plore curriculum or task-balanced training to improve uni-
formity across tasks. The benchmark is also grounded
in manipulation-centric egocentric environments, leaving
broader domains such as social interaction, navigation, and
outdoor activities largely unexplored.
