threshold ˆλ(a) for G(a). Following the standard split calibra-
tion protocol (Papadopoulos et al., 2002), the dataset is par-
titioned into a calibration set and a test set. The threshold is
learned solely from the calibration data for a user-specified
risk levelα, and is then fixed during test-time evaluation.
