human and LLM-based assessments. It consis-
tently scored highest in usefulness, reasoning, and
overall satisfaction, and was preferred in pairwise
comparisons for Q&A, slide decks, and podcasts.
LLaMA Graph RAG, in contrast, ranked lowest
across all dimensions, particularly struggling with
