Appendix B. Investigated LLMs
FinBERT is a BERT-based model that has already been fine-tuned with
several financial datasets, including the Financial PhraseBank dataset, the
FiQA dataset, Reuters-21578, SEC Filings (10-K/10-Q Reports) and other
financial news articles and financial-related Twitter data. It directly outputs
15
