Accelerating Bangla NLP Tasks with Automatic Mixed Precision: Resource-Efficient Training Preserving Model Efficacy,"Accelerating Bangla NLP Tasks with Automatic
Mixed Precision: Resource-Efficient Training
Preserving Model Efficacy
Md Mehrab Hossain Opi
Department of Computer Science and Engineering
Khulna University of Engineering & Technology
Khulna, Bangladesh
