ing action𝑎 in state𝑠,𝑁(𝑠,𝑎) is the number of times this action
has been selected at 𝑠,𝑁(𝑠)= ˝𝑎𝑁(𝑠,𝑎) is the total number of
visits to state𝑠, and𝑐 is an exploration coefficient that governs the
balance between exploitation (favoring actions with high estimated
value) and exploration (favoring actions that have been tried less
frequently).
Formally, the next action is selected as
𝑎∗ =arg max
