That is, from a difference of 0.10 MCQA points from
Llam to Gran, the top performer in that benchmark,
the difference becomes 0.40 points with CoRA. No-
tice that MCQA+ and MV keep gaps that are much
closer to that of MCQA, i.e. 0.16 and 0.10, respec-
