level, this corresponds to an average per-step slope
of 11.8 tokens per additional distractor and an
average reduction of 36.6 tokens when increasing
the number of distractors. Overall, these extents
indicate that the impact of the distractor count on
reasoning length is relatively slight.
However, within-image sampling variability is
substantial: the mean sampling standard deviation
is 122.4 tokens. Consequently, sampling noise over-
