7 Conclusion and Future Work
Fine-tuned transformer models can generate coherent and contextually relevant sum-
maries for long financial transcripts. The fine-tuned LED model achieved the high-
est precision-source and performed best on METEOR, MoverScore, FinBERTScore,
ROUGE-1,andROUGE-2scores.Thefine-tunedBART-largemodelexcelledinBERTScore
and SciBERTScore, while PEGASUS obtained the best F1-target as well as ROUGE-L
, balancing factual coverage and entity accuracy.
Future work can explore hybrid extractive-abstractive methods, enhanced attention
forlonginputs,andlightweightarchitecturestofurtherimproveaccuracyandefficiency
for real world financial summarization tasks.
