Ablation Experiment
To evaluate the contribution of each component in the ECPE-TextRank model for sentiment-based
text summarization, we conducted an ablation study involving two key modules: senti and topic.
Three variants were tested—w/o senti, w/o topic, and w/o senti & topic—by removing the specified
module(s) while keeping others unchanged.
