ABBEL: Learning Natural-Language Belief States for Memory-Efficient Interaction,"ABBEL: Learning Natural-Language Belief States for
Memory-Efficient Interaction
Aly Lidayan∗ dayan@berkeley.edu
University of California, Berkeley
Jakob Bjorner∗ jbjorner3@gatech.edu
Georgia Institute of Technology
Satvik Golechha zsatvik@gmail.com
Independent
Kartik Goyal kartikgo@gatech.edu
