A Belief Bottleneck Rollout
Algorithm 2Belief Bottleneck Rollout
Require:Instructionsp I; horizonH∈N; step functionT:S×A→S×O; initial states 0.
Require:Belief update promptp b; action selection promptpa; policyπ.
t←0
s←s 0
b←“This is the start of the game. No beliefs right now.”
whilet≤Hdo
a∼π(·|p I,b,p a)▷Action selection
s,o←T(s,a)▷Environment step: get new state and observation.
t←t+ 1
b∼π(·|p I,b,a,o,p b)▷Belief update.
