in STARE are S (position 1),A (3), R (4). Then T in position 2 is present but in a different spot. So
T must be in position 5? Because the only other positions are 2 (which wasT in STARE but it’s not
there), or 5. Because positions 1, 3, 4 are alreadyS, A, R. SoT must be in position 5. That makes
the target wordS _ A R T. So fifth letter isT. So structure isS _ A R T.
