5.3 Study III: MiA-GraphRAG for Global QA
We further evaluate MiA-RAG for global sense-
making in a GraphRAG QA setting, where it re-
trieves relevant graph nodes (entities) for holistic
document understanding and achieves clear gains
over baselines. Details are reported in Appx. D.4.
