6.4 Attention Pattern Analysis in the
Generation Model
(H3)MiA-Gen facilitatesIntegrative Reasoning
over retrieved chunks within the global mindscape.
To examine how the mindscape steers genera-
tion toward relevant evidence, we introduce the
Mindscape-Coherent Evidence Alignment metric
(MCEA). MCEA measures whether chunks receiv-
ing stronger mindscape attention are also preferen-
tially attended by the query, comparing this cou-
pling between relevant and noise chunks. Thus,
