C.3 Implementation Details
We set the chunk size to 1200 with an over-
lap of 100 tokens for NarrativeQA, DetectiveQA,
and ∞Bench, and to 200 for NoCha, following
the typical context length distributions of these
datasets. We build our retriever MiA-Emb by ap-
plying LoRA (Hu et al., 2022) on top of Qwen3-
Embedding-8B, and build our generator MiA-
Gen by fully fine-tuning Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct.
Throughout the paper, we denote Qwen2.5-72B
as the 4-bit quantized variant of Qwen2.5-72B-
Instruct to improve efficiency.GPT-4orefers to
GPT-4o-2411. For silver evidence construction, we
use Gte-Qwen-7B as the retriever Es and K= 10
for top-K in Algorithm 1. All hyperparameters are
summarized in Table 7.
