LetP be predicted boundaries andG gold boundaries, and letw be the tolerance window. Construct
a bipartite graph with edges(p,g )when |p−g|≤w . Compute a maximum-cardinality matching
M⊆P×G (ties broken arbitrarily or by minimum total distance). DefineTP =|M|, FP =|P|−TP ,
