Not controlledWe do not attempt to replicate each method’s original preprocessing, training
regime, or originally reported threshold tuning; therefore, we do not interpret discrepancies with
published single-number reports as errors, and we do not attribute differences uniquely to modeling
choices independent of preprocessing.
