and long-horizon dependencies.
3.2. Distilling Teacher Compressions
PAACE-FT trains a dedicated LLM to approximate the
teacher’s next-k-task–aware compression mapping. Let
x= (Π t:t+k, Ct) denote the input text and y= ˜Ct the
teacher’s compressed context. The student model is trained
with a standard causal language modeling loss:
