introducing alignment layers for modality fusion.
SALMONN (End-to-End).The architecture com-
bines a frozen Whisper encoder with a Vicuna de-
coder, linked by aQ-Formeralignment module.
Thisconfigurationpreservesstronglanguagepriors
while establishing an audio–text interface.
