A.4 ANALYSIS
The wig reviews show bipolar differentiation: high praise for natural aesthetics versus criticism of
quality flaws. The Base model consistently ignores negative feedback, while the RL model sharply
captures adverse details and makes reasonable judgments, highlighting its superior sensitivity to
inconsistencies, which we also found before in Sec. 5.3.
