B. Prompts - English Translations
For international readers, we provide English translations of the prompts used in our experiments:
B.1. Synthetic prompt generation - Translated
You are an expert in legal texts and communication. Your task is to analyze a court ruling and its
corresponding press release, and then determine what prompt could have been used to generate this press
release from the court ruling if it had been given to an LLM.
1. Analyze how the press release simplifies, restructures, and highlights key information from the ruling
2.Consider the tone, structure, and level of detail of the press release
