Knowledge-Guided Large Language Model for Automatic Pediatric Dental Record Understanding and Safe Antibiotic Recommendation,"Knowledge-Guided Large Language Model for
Automatic Pediatric Dental Record Understanding and
Safe Antibiotic Recommendation
Zihan Han1, Junyan Ge 2, Caifeng Li 3
1 School of Automation and Electrical Engineering, University of Jinan, Jinan,
China
2 College of Dental Medicine, Columbia University, New York, NY, USA
3 Jilin University, Changchun, China
11812503968@qq.com
