3.4 Safety-Constrained Antibiotic Recommendation Module
The final step is generating a safe antibiotic recommendation tailored to the patient’s age,
weight, infection severity, allergy profile, and contraindication conditions. The model uses a
constrained decoding strategy where candidate antibiotic outputs are validated by a
