D. Evaluation
To evaluate personality recognition performance, we employ
standard metrics: Regular Accuracy (RA) (Eq. 7) to assess the
model accuracy, Balanced Accuracy (BA) (Eq. 8) to measure
model performance on imbalanced datasets (which should be
nearly identical to RA for balanced datasets), and the F1 Score
(Eq. 9) to evaluate model bias. Here,T P,F P,T N, andF N
denote true positives, false positives, true negatives, and false
negatives, respectively.
