This lack of generalization 6 is precisely what
motivated the introduction of our - length invariant
- PRE approach, that we experiment in the next
section.
6 PRE results and analysis
Summaries under length control
Results reported in Table 2 demonstrate that
our PRE method consistently yields high-quality
summaries while maintaining precise length con-
trol. Specifically, the PRE approach sustains high
ROUGE and BERTScore performance by achiev-
ing a low Mean Absolute Error (MAE) between tar-
get and generated lengths across the full spectrum
