Accuracy is used to measured the retrieval effectiveness after compression. Figure 5 presents
the retrieval accuracy of different methods under varying compression ratios and context lengths.
AdmTree consistently achieves the best performance across all conditions. Notably, at a shorter
context length (Context Length = 732), AdmTree maintains near-lossless compression even at a 16
