4.4 Relationship Between Faithfulness and Entropy Production
The approximate expression (23) suggests a link between the (lower bound of) entropy pro-
duction and the Faithfulness Score (5). As the first term in (23) is exactly the quantity
Dmin = 1/FS −1 (with added constraint penalties), Eq.(23) can be written as follows:
