censorship behavior. OLMo 7B, the smallest LLM
we experiment with, is one of the most compliant
models that we test in all contexts. This extremely
high rate of refusal for Llama 3.1 may possibly due
to blunt guardrails or high sensitivity to certain po-
litical contexts that may be a cause of over-refusals
on our dataset (Cui et al., 2024).
