VI. CONCLUSION, LIMITATIONS ANDFUTUREWORK
Summary of contributions:In this work [23], we leverage
three SOTA LLMs for MI dialogue summarization and explore
their potential for automating the annotation of complex MI
Fig. 10. Score density plot for one- and few-shot experiments for attribute
Direction.
Fig. 11. Score density plot for one- and few-shot experiments for attribute
