further demonstrate the versatility of our approach,
we use the closed-source Gemini-2.5-Flash as the
LLM agent, as shown in Table 3. PRInTS provides
4.0% absolute average accuracy gain, whereas the
second-best method improves performance by only
1.5%. On the most challenging subset, GAIA Level
3, PRInTS yields the largest improvement among
all baselines (+5.5%), showing its strength on long-
