7 Conclusions
Thispaperinvestigatestheuseofstate-of-the-artlargelanguagemodels—specifically
Mistral 7B and mT5—for Czech text summarization, addressing both contem-
porary and historical domains. In addition to direct summarization, we propose
a novel translation-based pipeline, which first translates Czech input texts into
English, performs summarization using an English-language model, and subse-
quently translates the summaries back into Czech. This method leverages the
strength of English-language models in low-resource scenarios.
