ments, (4) detailed formatting and style guidelines to ensure consistent, high-quality outputs, and (5) speciﬁc constraints to
prevent common LLM analysis pitfalls such as uncertainty statements or direct classiﬁcation references. This carefully crafted
prompt structure ensures generated analyses maintain technical precision while providing comprehensive coverage of script
functionality or malicious behaviors.
