showcase slightly different convergence patterns that guided
our checkpoint selection process. For Annotator V1 (Fig-
ure 16), trained on the 900 high-quality seed samples, the
validation loss decreases smoothly throughout training. Op-
timal performance is reached at epoch 11 (step 154), where
