In summary, M-CoT enhances the modeling capability of traditional multimodal large models for
complex semantic relationships through structured reasoning paths and effectively alleviates the
interpretability issues of ”black-box” prediction. As a novel multimodal reasoning paradigm, M-
CoT bridges the gap between modality perception and logical deduction, providing strong support
for improving the performance and interpretability of multimodal tasks.
