gree of exploration during search, and thecandidate number
K∈[1,10]for MCTS expansion.
Experiments are conducted on thesentiment generation
task using bothGPT-XLandLlama-3-8B. As shown in
Fig. 5 (left), increasingwenhances exploration, but leads
