A Survey on Efficient Large Language Model Training: From Data-centric Perspectives,"A Survey on Efficient Large Language Model Training:
From Data-centric Perspectives
Junyu Luo1, Bohan Wu1, Xiao Luo2†, Zhiping Xiao3†, Yiqiao Jin4, Rong-Cheng Tu5,
Nan Yin6,Yifan Wang 7,Jingyang Yuan 1,Wei Ju 1,Ming Zhang 1†
