T owards Summarization Attribution for Analysts*
Violet B, John M. Conroy 1, Sean Lynch2, Danielle M, Neil P . Molino1, Aaron Wiechmann2, and Julia S. Yang 1
1 IDA Center for Computing Sciences, Bowie, MD, USA; {conroy,npmolin,jsyang}@super.org
