mimic the needs of crisis managers from the Federal Emergency Management Agency as they monitor an
ongoing disaster, such as a fire or flood.
2 In particular, we filtered the data so that min_sum_len=200, max_sum_len=5000, min_doc_len=100, where
length is measured in characters.
