efficient Transformer variants, is designed to understand and generate human language by predicting the
likelihood of word sequences. Language models vary in size and capability. Representative language models are
summarized in Table 1. In the early stage, the research attention mainly focus on the relatively small language
model (𝑒.𝑔.,BERT [39]). The models are designed to be lightweight neural language models, typically ranging from
