Enabling Conversational Behavior Reasoning Capabilities in Full-Duplex Speech,"ENABLINGCONVERSATIONALBEHAVIORREASONING
CAPABILITIES INFULL-DUPLEXSPEECH
Shuchang Pan1∗, Siddharth Banerjee2∗, Dhruv Hebbar2∗, Siddhant Patel2∗,
Akshaj Gupta2, Kan Jen Cheng2, Hanjo Kim2, Zeyi Austin Li2, Martin Q. Ma3, Tingle Li2
Gopala Anumanchipalli2, Jiachen Lian2†
