To evaluate our LLM-as-a-judge rubric-grading setup, we
measure inter-rater agreement between model-generated and
human-assigned labels across the full dataset. Human an-
notators are instructed to grade randomly sampled GPT 4o
Audio Preview or Gemini 2.5 Pro responses according to
