Average Pass Rate (APR).The APR is a strict metric measuring the percentage of tasks where the model satisfies
allassociated rubric criteria. We define a binary pass indicator pi for task i, where pi = 1 if ∏Nij=1 1rij = 1, and 0
otherwise. The overall APR is the mean of these binary indicators:
