Second, we emphasize that all data in ROLERMBENCHis ultimately labeled by three human annotators.
DeepSeek is used solely to reduce annotator workload by removing clearly invalid pairs in advance. The
following table shows the number of remaining samples at each annotation stage for an initial pool of 1000
samples.
