¯P. Second, response selection loss determines
whether the relation between the two sentences
is entailment or not. This can facilitate select-
ing the next dialogue utterance during dialogue
learning. Lastly, relation prediction loss aligns the
relation score vector ˆzRL with the NLI score vec-
tor zRL. Further details of the training objective
are discussed in Section 3.2.4.
