focuses on predicting the target response R based
on persona sentences P and dialogue history H.
The response selection loss involves selecting the
next dialogue utterance from the gold response
R and distractor responses D based on the per-
sona sentences and dialogue history. Finally, the
relation prediction loss aligns the relation score
vectors ˆz with the NLI score vectors z.
