task—premise and hypothesis in relation learn-
ing, and persona sentences and target response in
dialogue learning—aligning the relation score vec-
tor ˆz closely with the NLI score vector z enables
BART to acquire the relation prediction capa-
bility of the NLI expert. This alignment allows
the model to leverage necessary persona informa-
tion from context during inference without explicit
relations.
