prompt-guided LLM to select the best candidate:
𝑣=𝑓(𝑒,𝑣 list,𝐼𝑉𝐿),(5)
where𝐼𝑉𝐿 is a handcrafted prompt instructing the LLM to assess
label similarity, favoring exact matches when available. To support
