[7, 9, 39, 61], MMWOZ stands out by requiring the system
agent to manipulate a web-style GUI to retrieve database
information and respond to the user based on the displayed
GUI information. The most similar dataset to MMWOZ is
META-GUI [40] dataset, which focuses on dialogue tasks
involving 11 real-world Android mobile apps. However,
MMWOZ primarily focuses on information-rich web-style
