information-rich web page, particularly containing a sub-
stantial amount of text information. The accuracy of the
system’sresponsetotheusergreatlyreliesonthecorrectness
of this text information. To extract and capture the textual
content from the web page snapshot, we employ Tesser-
act4, a widely-used open-source tool for Optical Character
Recognition (OCR) parsing. Given a snapshot𝑁of a web
page, using the OCR parser, the text information𝑁𝑡𝑒𝑥𝑡 can
be obtained:
