posterior probability of assigning samplex 𝑖 to intent clusterC𝑘,
i.e., soft assignment. Following the practice indeep clustering[ 38],
we employ the classic Gaussian kernel to measure the similarity
between samplex𝑖 and centroid 𝝁𝑘, and then transform it into the
posterior probability via the softmax function:
𝑃(C𝑘|x𝑖)= exp(−∥x𝑖−𝝁 𝑘∥2)˝𝐾
