4.4 PAda-PPO
Leveraging M2PC, each input within a batch is
routed to either G(β)Major or G(β)Minor based on
the model yielding lower perplexity, as shown in
Figure 2. We employ PPO (Schulman et al., 2017)
with a clipped objective algorithm for training. Fol-
lowing Luong et al. (2024), the value model Vϕ is
contructed by appending a linear value head on top
of the last hidden states of the policy model G(ξ),
which is initialized from the SFT modelG(θ).
