The EU helps citizens access healthcare across borders by
supporting national systems and ensuring legal rights to
cross-border care. [FOLLOWUP QUESTION] Would you like to
learn how scheduled treatments abroad are covered?’’,
‘‘section’’: ‘‘blog_introduction’’
