Instance Relation Learning Network with Label Knowledge Propagation for Few-shot Multi-label Intent Detection,"Instance Relation Learning Network with Label Knowledge Propagation for
Few-shot Multi-label Intent Detection
Shiman Zhao1,2,3 ,Shangyuan Li 1,2,3 ,Wei Chen ∗1,2,3 ,Tengjiao Wang 1,2,3,4
Jiahui Yao1,2,3 ,Jiabin Zheng 1,2,3 andKam Fai Wong 1,4
1Key Lab of High Confidence Software Technologies (MOE), School of Computer Science, Peking
University, Beijing, China.
2Research Center for Computational Social Science, Peking University, Beijing, China.
