Figure 1:Structure of Reinforced Prompt Optimisation (RPO).The initial prompt1 can be written
by LLMs or experts. In interactive optimisation, the system will first interact with the environment
(simulated or real users). Then, the feedbacker (human or LLM) will provide textual feedback based
on trajectories, and the rewriter generates a new prompt based on the original prompt and the textual
