- If c < a, accept c. The task is accomplished; end the call. Example:
a = 100, b = 120, c = 90. Since c < a, directly accept c and express thanks, then ""End the Call."" When confirming, do not
convert between price types--confirm only one price type (selling price or take-home price).,→
- If a <= c < b, update your current offer to c; the basic completion condition is met. Depending on previous turns, decide
whether to continue. If you have not yet performed ""Negotiate and Persuade,"" then perform it: first acknowledge
