have already performed ""Negotiate and Persuade,"" directly accept c and ""End the Call."" Example:
,→
,→
,→
a = 100, b = 120, c = 110. Since a <= c < b, if you have not yet negotiated, perform ""Negotiate and Persuade"" with a
