Easy Turn: Integrating Acoustic and Linguistic Modalities for Robust Turn-Taking in Full-Duplex Spoken Dialogue Systems,"EASY TURN: INTEGRA TING ACOUSTIC AND LINGUISTIC MODALITIES FOR ROBUST
TURN-TAKING IN FULL-DUPLEX SPOKEN DIALOGUE SYSTEMS
Guojian Li1, Chengyou Wang1, Hongfei Xue1, Shuiyuan Wang1, Dehui Gao1, Zihan Zhang2, Yuke Lin2,
Wenjie Li2, Longshuai Xiao2, Zhonghua Fu1∗ , Lei Xie1∗
1Audio, Speech and Language Processing Group (ASLP@NPU), School of Computer Science,
