gradients. Then a feed-forward network FFN with RELU is applied
upon the normalization result, which helps further enhance the
expressiveness of the module. A residual connection is adopted to
help gradient flow. Finally, the multi-head mechanism is applied to
help the attention module capture diverse features of the input.
In RSM-DCK, the last utterance of the context is used as a query
