FLEXI: Benchmarking Full-duplex Human-LLM Speech Interaction,"FLEXI: BENCHMARKING FULL-DUPLEX HUMAN-LLM SPEECH INTERACTION
Yuan Ge1†, Saihan Chen1†, Jingqi Xiao1, Xiaoqian Liu1, Tong Xiao1,2‡,
Yan Xiang3, Zhengtao Yu3, Jingbo Zhu1,2
