Proactive planning, which prevents error-prone conditions and conversation defeat, is
possible through exploiting effective intermediate conversation information, but most
of prior works in exploiting explicit intermediate information are limited to predefined
slots, intents, query information and its products. Besides, in previous predefined slots
and intent-based models, modeling preferences centered on extracting and exploiting
