The implemented method is domain-independent but does not conduct domain
identification. In task completion models on entity search platforms, users commonly
indicate the domain initially and then peruse information within that indicated
domain. In this paper, the domain-dependent information—such as predefined slots
characterizations, and corresponding databases— is configured in pre-processing. We
will then perform the constant program with certain domain-dependent parameters
configured in pre-processing. The LLM exploited in this paper’s implementations is
GPT-4o.
