The templates should be declarative instructions, not
questions.
The emotions are: happy, sad, angry, surprise, fearful.
Here is an example: Please answer the following ques-
tion with a <emotion> tone.
Only output 20 templates, one per line, with no addi-
tional explanation.
Ensure that the instruction flows naturally and
smoothly when the <emotion> tag is replaced with an
