after the pretraining. We achieve state-of-the-art
accuracy on all three types of emotional cognitive
tasks, surpassing the base model and EmoLLama.
To be consistent with our RL training, we use the
Llama3-based version for the subsequent formal
experiments. Table 2 shows a good case of emotion
cognition.
