Prompts of Actor, Critic and RM.This prompt
guides the assistant to first infer an appropriate con-
versational strategy based on the user’s emotional
state and dialogue history, and then generate a fit-
ting response that aligns with that strategy.
The Critic and Reward model’s prompt should
be aligned with the Actor’s to accurately evaluate
the state value and reward.
