Dialogue Dataset on Southeast Asian Languages
Muhammad Dehan Al Kautsar1*, Aswin Candra2∗, Muhammad Alif Al Hakim3∗,
Maxalmina Satria Kahfi4∗, Fajri Koto1, Alham Fikri Aji1, Peerat Limkonchotiwat5,
