most relevant Wikipedia passages as evidence for
each verifiable atomic fact; third, they verify each
atomic fact against the selected evidence and dia-
logue history, assigning one of three labels —Sup-
ports,Refutes, orNot Enough Information. All an-
notators perform these steps independently. Since
the datasets are in English, only annotators with
good English proficiency are selected. None of
them have prior experience with AI or LLMs, nor fa-
