5.4. Results on GPT-4o-Annotated
Datasets
Table5presentsresultsontheautomateddatasets.
Overall trends mirror those observed on the
human-annotated datasets: performance in-
creases after applying CoT and few-shot CoT. Two
differences stand out. First, scores on HybriDi-
