smaller than 0.50 for the ﬁrst time at the minimum T . For En-
glish response naturalness, the prefetched response had an aver-
age score µ: 4.17 (variance σ2: 0.54), and the actual response
had µ = 4.25 (σ2 = 0.49). For Japanese response naturalness,
