ficiency and robustness of our model in low-data
scenarios.
4.3.4 DST Task Performance
To further exploit the abilities of the proposed Spec-
TOD, we evaluate the performance of the Function
Calling (for DST) task, which is illustrated in Fig-
ure 5. Accordingly, the reported results indicate
that with training on 10% of the data, Spec-TOD
with Llama-3-8B outperforms GPT-3.5 and GPT-4
under zero-shot prompting.
5 Conclusion
TOD systems have long posed challenges in NLP
due to limited flexibility and scalability to unseen
domains. Recent emerging LLM technologies have
