revolutionized NLP applications by enabling zero-
shot and few-shot generalization capabilities. How-
ever, utilizing LLMs for tasks requiring knowledge
grounding, such as TOD, continues to be a critical
challenge that warrants further study, especially for
end-to-end TOD systems. Therefore, this study
presents a novel few-shot learning method for end-
to-end TOD systems via instruction tuning with
open-weight LLMs. The evaluation of various ver-
sions of the MultiWoz datasets indicates promising
results of our proposed method with 10% of the
training samples.
