sharp trajectory distribution of LLMs. This of-
ten leads to high variance in IS weight estimates,
even when the behaviour and target policies only
diverge slightly. To mitigate this, we compute IS
weights only over intents and slots of dialogue ac-
tionsda t,intent+slot, and clip them to[1−η,1 +η]:
