A.5 Training Configurations
The predefined set for token selection in the following equations are:
In Equation 2,E={neutral, fearful, dissatisfied, apologetic, abusive, excited, satisfied}.
In Equation 3,D={general, restaurant, hotel, train, attraction, taxi, police, hospital}, which includes
the seven EmoWOZ domains plus an additional “general” domain to handle small-talk and greetings.
In Equation 10,C={neutral, compassionate, apologetic, enthusiastic, appreciative}.
T5NLU achieves a slot F1 of 86.5%; LangEmoUS reports a macro F1 of 52.1% for emotion prediction.
