over System_A (LUSTER-base) based on more nuanced system behaviours as highlighted in blue colour
above, with the following explanation:
System_B demonstrates better overall performance compared to system_A. It successfully engages the user by
immediately presenting the number of trains available for their specified criteria, which adds a layer of informa-
