H.2.4. C ONVERSATION FORMAT
Conversation format: txt
The conversations are presented in a .txt format. One .txt file corresponds to one conversation.
Example:
[00.01:00.03] User: Hello
[00.04:00.05] Bot: How are you doing?
Here, for turn 1:
• 00.01 is the start timestamp
• 00.03 is the end timestamp
• ”User” is the speaker
• ”Hello” is the said content
Note:
• One turn is one intervention of either the user or of the bot.
• If multiple consecutive turns present the same issue, you can just annotate the first turn.
