I ve been having stomach pain and vomiting after eating ... I 
tend to rush through meals, and it leads to indigestion.
Hello! How long have you been experiencing these 
symptoms?
It s been almost a month. I keep vomiting after eating.
What medicine do you recommend, doctor?
This situation suggests a high possibility of gastritis 
or peptic ulcer.
You can try taking omeprazole, Daxi, and amoxicillin 
