4 Experimental Setup
4.1 Datasets
We conduct experimental evaluations on two
widely used benchmarks, MedDG and Kamed.
MedDG contains over 17,000 medical dialogues
annotated with 160 medical entities across 5 cate-
gories: diseases, symptoms, medications, examina-
tions, and attributes. It is officially split into 14,862
(train), 1,999 (validation), and 999 (test) sessions.
