Your task is to analyze the supporter's statements based on the intention definitions and 
conversation content, considering the supporter's goals and anticipated outcomes, and generate a 
concise statement of the intention. The generated intention needs to include specific 
information from the conversation and cannot directly use the definition. Only generate the 
intention, no need to generate an explanation. If the intention cannot be inferred, generate 
'None'.
