We automatically annotate emotional states and
emotional support intentions on the ESConv data,
incorporating the dataset’s own strategies and re-
sponses to form the ICECoT data. We conduct ex-
periments using LLAMA3.1-8B-Instruct † (Dubey
et al., 2024) and train this model on 4 A6000 GPUs,
with a batch size of 2 per GPU, a learning rate of
1e-5, and a maximum sequence length of 4096.
