4 Experiments
We conducted experiments using three widely used
single-domain datasets for DP research: movie-
ticket booking, restaurant reservation, and taxi or-
dering, based on the Microsoft Dialogue Challenge
platform (Li et al., 2017, 2016, 2018; Zhao et al.,
2024; Niu et al., 2024). To assess the generaliz-
