agents for its strong generative abilities and popularity. We
also evaluated other open-source LLMs such as LLaMA 3 and
Gemma2, but their performance was far inferior to ChatGPT-
4.0, so only the results of the latter are reported. Tailored
prompts are detailed in Appendix A.
