generated through: (1) Design domains, tasks, and attributes manually; (2) LLM generate subjects based on domain,
task and manually designed examples with LLM; (3) Generate user questions based on subject, domain, task,
manually designed examples and the candidate attributes from Section 3.1 with LLM; (4) Generate GT responses
based on task, user question and candidate attributes with LLM. User history is generated based on the related
