acteristics: behavior analysis requires understand-
ing complex psychological factors; recommenda-
tion system focuses on more concrete matching;
the subjective nature of action guide leads to con-
servative scoring by AI judges. Successfully solv-
ing these hard scenarios will have substantial model
performance gains. Moreover, error analyses on
hard scenarios can develop a deeper understanding
of how models interpret human behavioral patterns.
