We train Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct with 4 A100 GPU
using LLaMA-Factory †. Each of the 3 training
processes takes 1-1.5 hours. Table 7 shows the
hyper-parameters used in our SFT experiments. We
use default values without tuning and report results
for each evaluation experiment from a single run.
