CoDial: Interpretable Task-Oriented Dialogue Systems Through Dialogue Flow Alignment,"CoDial: Interpretable Task-Oriented Dialogue Systems
Through Dialogue Flow Alignment
Radin Shayanfar1,2, Chu Fei Luo1,2, Rohan Bhambhoria1,2,
Samuel Dahan2,3, and Xiaodan Zhu1,2,4
1Department of Electrical and Computer Engineering & Ingenuity Labs, Queen’s University
