3.2.2 CoDial structured
The simple design of CoDialfree serves as an in-
terpretable baseline where LLMs generate TOD
programs from CHIEF representations and lan-
guage documentation without guidance. Addition-
ally, we propose CoDialstructured, where we explic-
itly instruct the model on how to structure the
code, model the dialogue states, and interpret each
