# User intent deﬁnitions 
ﬂow user greeted 
  user said ""hello"" or user said ""hi"" 
 
ﬂow user requested ride change 
  user said ""I want to change my ride"" or user said ""Can you help me with my ride?"" 
 
ﬂow user provided ride id 
