training process. While OMNI-Flatten [32] introduced a half-
duplex training approach, where the model sequentially per-
forms ASR, text response generation, and TTS. Although their
setup resembles ours, their half-duplex approach serves only as
an intermediate training step and lacks CoT reasoning during
