To realize the formulation described in Eq.1, this work pro-
poses a CoT E2E spoken dialog system, as shown in Figure 1c.
The architecture is built around a pre-trained decoder-only LM
capable of both processing and generating audio and text to-
kens. The CoT model follows a structured decoding process:
ASR Decoding: Generates the ASR transcript ˆSasr by model-
ing P (Sasr|X). Text Response Prediction : Predicts the text
