category of information from the patient’s profile is mentioned in the patient’s current
utterance. Use the dialogue history as context. For each category, output:
• ‘1’ if the information is mentioned in the current utterance.
• ‘0’ if it is not mentioned.
Additionally, provide a brief explanation for your decision. Please evaluate the following cat-
egories are relevant to the patient’s current utterance: ‘age’, ‘gender’, ‘race’, ‘tobacco’, ‘alco-
hol’, ‘illicit_drug’, ‘sexual_history’, ‘exercise’, ‘marital_status’, ‘children’, ‘living_situation’,
‘occupation’, ‘insurance’, ‘allergies’, ‘family_medical_history’, ‘medical_device’, ‘medi-
