Dialogue-level evaluationIn dialogue-level evaluation, we extract a derived profile ˆP i =
{ˆxi1,ˆxi2, . . . ,ˆxiK} from the dialogue Di, and compare it to the original profile P i. For each item such
that both the original and derived items are present, we compute the semantic similarity between xij
and ˆxij. Profile extraction is carried out using the prompt in Figure D13, and the semantic similarity
per item is computed using the method described in Figure D14.
Prompt template for extract patient’s profile from the dialogue history
[System Prompt]
Instruction: You are an AI assistant designed to extract structured medical information from
