GAP: Graph-Assisted Prompts for
Dialogue-based Medication Recommendation
Jialun Zhong1,2, Yanzeng Li1, Sen Hu2, Yang Zhang2,
Teng Xu2, and Lei Zou1 (␀ )
1 Wangxuan Institute of Computer Technology, Peking University, Beijing, China
2 Ant Group
