3.2 Medical Information Extraction
Capturing key medical information from the dialogue history can play a crucial
role in MDS [25]. The extracted information can be used for relevant knowledge
retrieval to enhance the response generation. Inspired by previous works [33],
we adopt a two-stage method for medical information extraction. Without loss
of generality, for patient’s utterancepm, we first identify all medical concepts
