Note that we exclude s0 and a0 from the optimiza-
tion problem, since the conversation typically be-
gins with a predefined opening from the system.
By Markov property, p(st, at|st−1, at−1) =p(st,
at|s1:t−1, a1:t−1) = p(s1:t, a1:t|s1:t−1, a1:t−1).
Therefore, the likelihood of the trajectory pθ(τ0:T )
can be rewritten as follows:
pθp,θe(τ0:T ) =p(s0, a0) ·
