D Details of Sell-to-List Ratio Calculation
The Sell-to-List ratio (Zhou et al., 2019) measures
the amount of benefit the buyer or the seller re-
ceives compared to the initial listing price. From
the buyer’s side, since the target is to negotiate
for the lowest possible price with the seller, the
