Figure A7, Figure A8 and Figure A9, respectively.
G Example Conversations
We provide example conversations from the
Craigslist dataset in Figure A10 and Figure A11,
with the system acting as the buyer and seller, re-
spectively. We also provide example conversations
from the Topdial and PersonaChat datasets in Fig-
ure A12 and Figure A13, respectively.
H Human Evaluation Results on the
CraigslistBargain Dataset
To ensure the reliability of our evaluation results,
we recruit 5 independent volunteer annotators with
good educational background and ask them to con-
duct a blind evaluation, comparing the conversation
quality of DiffTOD and the best-performing base-
line, PPDPP (Deng et al., 2024b), on the Craigslist-
Bargain dataset. Due to limited resource, we ran-
domly sample 50 conversations from all the test
cases, and ask human evaluators to provide a pair-
wise comparison between the conversation with
