4.2.3 Stage 3: User-Aware Policy Planning. Ultimately, in the
planning phase, the agent considers both the user’s profile and
potential user reacts for each possible strategy. By integrating all
available information, the agent determines the optimal strategy.
To achieve this, we propose a user-aware policy planner𝑃𝑎, as
