we feed s𝑡−1 along with user persona features p into a multi-layer
Transformer, yielding a fused representation of dialogue state and
user personas sp𝑡−1∈ R1×𝑑, where𝑑 is the output dimension of
E. Each candidate strategy feature a𝑖 is concatenated with cor-
responding predicted user reaction z𝑖, forming an action feature
𝐴𝑖 = MLP([ a𝑖; z𝑖])∈ R𝑑, thus defining the action space represen-
tation A =[𝐴𝑖]𝐾𝑖=1∈ R𝐾×𝑑, where𝐾 is the size of the strategy set.
