0, otherwise
Accuracy Reward The accuracy-based reward is a binary metric that evaluates the exact match
between the predicted intent ˆyt and the ground truth label yt. We employ a regular expression-based
method to extract the predicted intent from the model’s output.
Ranswer =
1, if the answer ˆyt fully matches the ground truth yt
