OCEAN); and (2) KQR_random, KQR_CD, KQR(latent)_random, and
KQR(latent)_CD are the cumulative rewards from KQR variants.
In Figs. 7(a) and 7(b), we show the cumulative rewards for GT,
Pred_GT, and the eight counterfactual inference variants. The cu-
mulative reward predictions of the eight variants for𝑁 = 50 coun-
