First, we can observe that the cumulative rewards from GT and
Pred_GT are nearly overlapping and the total donations are very
close. This means that the DDP model is highly accurate in its
predictions of the ground truth cumulative rewards. This is very
important as it gives credence to the next set of cumulative re-
